From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:34:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: qualcomm: ppe: scope topology invalidation

Keep direct path and bypassed-upper dependencies for each flow.
Retire only flows affected by a device event, including routed
wireless VP rules. Reject publication across a topology change.
Walk the locked owner array once instead of restarting hash walks;
preserve the existing delete, quarantine and hardware lease rules.

Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
